%% sequence.mmd - mermaid source of a figure in the project report
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Camera
    participant D as Object detector
    participant M as Material classifier
    participant X as Cross-check
    participant U as Uncertainty and family sets
    participant S as Contamination sensors
    participant E as Decision engine
    participant A as Actuator and log
    C->>D: frame
    D->>M: box and cropped item
    D->>X: object name and confidence
    M->>X: 33 class probabilities
    X->>U: fused probabilities (hazards untouched)
    U->>E: uncertainty and set of plausible families
    S->>E: moisture and gas scores (contamination index)
    E->>A: hazardous bin, priority review, contamination reject or family bin
    A-->>C: next item
